sourceData.deleteNode:
物品数量归零、被完全消耗、丢失或摧毁时删除。
SQL示例: DELETE FROM warehouse WHERE owner = '艾瑟尔' AND item_name = '强酸体液小滴瓶';
SQL示例(批量): DELETE FROM warehouse WHERE quantity <= 0;

sourceData.updateNode:
数量变化、状态变化、存放位置变化时更新。
SQL示例: UPDATE warehouse SET quantity = quantity - 1 WHERE owner = '绝燕' AND item_name = '劣质抗寒注射液';
SQL示例(入库): UPDATE warehouse SET storage = '主神空间仓库' WHERE owner = '艾瑟尔' AND item_name = 'T病毒原液';

每轮推进时更新时间三件套；地点/阶段/主线任一变化时同步对应列。
SQL示例(推进): UPDATE godspace_global SET prev_scene_time = '2026-10-31 15:00', elapsed_time = '4小时15分', cur_time = '2026-10-31 19:15' WHERE row_id = 1;
SQL示例(返回主神空间): UPDATE godspace_global SET phase = '幕间', world_name = '主神空间', quest_status = '已完成', current_location = '汉白玉广场', current_major_region = '主神空间' WHERE row_id = 1;
